    "annotations": [
        {
            "id": "ann_1",
            "type": "note",
            "text": "WebRenderTOP — WebGL Shader\n\nA full-screen WebGL2 fragment shader running in the browser.\nThe kaleidoscope pattern is rendered by the GPU inside Chromium.\n\nWebRenderTOP captures the browser's rendered output as a texture,\nwhich can then be composited with other GONODES TOPs.\n\nThis demonstrates using the browser as a shader playground —\ncompare with ShadertoyTOP for native Godot GLSL shaders.",
            "position": [-50.0, -50.0],
